# `vilan build .` writes the bundle (any `const` style sidecar, and the leg's
# build manifest) beside the entry it came from. Generated output is not
# checked in.
*.js
*.css
*.chunks.json
# `dist/` holds what the build records for itself — today the `[[build.hook]]`
# freshness stamp. Deleting it re-runs every hook, which is the point.
dist/
